#. ~ Description of gun "Graf 335L"
#. ~ Description of "Graf 335L"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
msgid ""
"A laser pistol of tremendous power, equally as likely to melt its targets as "
"it is to melt itself.  Powerful enough to punch through heavy military armor,"
" it'll win most shootouts so long as you can end them in three shots or less."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Izhevsk PLC-75"
#. ~ Description of "Izhevsk PLC-75"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
msgid ""
"Straight from the bureaus of the old Soviet Union the PLC-75 is the crude and"
" brutal answer to the constraints posed by the design of heavy laser "
"ordnance.  Its use of antiquated flashtube pumped laser technology makes it "
"unwieldy and wholly incompatible with modern equipment, whether this offers "
"any advantage to downrange targets remains a matter of contentious dispute."
msgstr ""

