#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"Clad in sable and gold armor, this luxurious combat humaniform is intended to"
" serve as a bodyguard to society's wealthiest.  Still with its wrist sword "
"extended, it resembles an ancient knight, standing an eternal watch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid "Parallax-3A secutor"
msgid_plural "Parallax-3A secutors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Parallax-3A secutor"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"Pitted steel and silicon will remain steadfast even after it's charge was "
"long claimed by the unyielding cold.  Its single azure eye casts a cruel and "
"calculating gaze upon the ruins of an universe made unfamiliar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid "Parallax-3E veles"
msgid_plural "velites"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Parallax-3E veles"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"It walks heavily, each step resonating with the weight of its rust-bitten "
"frame.  A single azure eye scans its surroundings with predatory hunger, and "
"any movement is met by the destructive gaze of a grafted light-cannon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_outfitter.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_tool_trader.json
msgid "I want to buy some gear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid "hawker "
msgstr ""

#. ~ Job description of "hawker " NPC class
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid "A vendor selling street food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid "Trés Landwell"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid "hawker"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid ""
"&The food stall is a colorful array of various dishes, and the smell of spices and cooked meats cuts easily through the frozen air.  The vendor  is busy preparing a meal when you approach.\n"
"\"Oh steemd do you see anything you like?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid "I'll have whatever it is you're cooking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid "Are these things safe to eat?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_street_food.json
msgid ""
"&The vendor chuckles at your question, wiping his hands on his apron.\n"
"Safe?  Yes very safe steemd, snow dry and clean steemd.  In home we do not have so much snow, but here it is very good for food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
msgid ""
"Let me be first to welcome you to Salus IV orbit.  I'm the portmaster "
"representative for this section of the station, and I can help you with "
"booking passage planetside for you and any cargo.\"  They glance briefly to a"
" desk console before continuing with a well trained smile.  \"Oh it seems "
"system flagged you as a new arrival, are you familiar with local planetary "
"conditions?  If not, I can provide you with a starting kit that will help you"
" survive the first few days planetside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
msgid "Alright, let see about passage planetside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
msgid "I'm interested in that starting kit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
msgid ""
